# This repository is PUBLIC. The entries below are internal strategy documents,
# unpublished results and handover notes that have been sitting untracked in
# docs/ — one `git add docs/` away from being published. The rules above cover
# the three docs subdirectories but not loose files at the top of docs/, so
# these are named explicitly (2026-09-22). Patterns are deliberately specific
# rather than docs/*.html or docs/*.pdf, which would also shadow the two
# research PDFs this repo publishes on purpose.
docs/Meru_Prabhasa_MVP_Pitch-*.html
docs/thomson-technical-report.pdf
docs/pitch-*.md
